     "text": "Some other relevant properties should be mentioned. There is an antigenic relationship between the human and murine strains, but none has been detected between avian strains and the others. A hacmagglutinin has been detected by certain workers using avian infectious bronchitis virus and also antigens separable from the virus particle, but these have so far not been recorded for the human or murine strains.",
